{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "A Musical Affair feels like a natural next choice because I enjoyed A Musical Affair: Live in Japan and want to explore the closely related album.",
    "The Impossible Dream's theatrical association connects with my interest in Stages, while Sanremo Grande Amore suggests the romantic vocal appeal I enjoyed in Amor & Pasion."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The Christmas albums connect with my past listening, but I am not seeking seasonal music right now.",
    "A country collection is not my current priority, and titles such as Uncharted and The Ultimate Collection give me too little evidence of the expressive vocals or orchestral sound I want."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My earlier Christmas listening seems to have been treated as an ongoing desire for holiday albums.",
    "My country listening seems to have been stretched into interest in more country releases, even though that is not what I am seeking now."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My latest interaction with relaxing classical music adds to my current interest in orchestral listening.",
    "I need a recognizable connection to music I enjoyed, such as a related album or theatrical song association, before I would choose an unfamiliar title."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The choices partly capture my interest in expressive vocal music, but give too much weight to past seasonal and country listening when I currently want vocal or orchestral music."
}"}
